00:00:00,130 --> 00:00:01,710
D2.

2
00:00:01,710 --> 00:00:08,945
Read Millie's suggestion letter to the head teacher of Sunshine Middle School.

3
00:00:08,945 --> 00:00:18,560
Dear Mr Zhang, I am writing to make some suggestions to improve our school life.

4
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:30,070
First, I would like to suggest that our school should provide more ping pong tables, then more students can play ping pong during breaks.

5
00:00:30,070 --> 00:00:35,830
Second, I think we should have more books in the library.

6
00:00:35,830 --> 00:00:40,870
They can help us enjoy reading and open our minds.

7
00:00:40,870 --> 00:00:45,320
What's more, we need more computers in the library.

8
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:50,250
This way, it will be easier for us to search online.

9
00:00:50,250 --> 00:00:54,890
I hope my suggestions help improve our school life.

10
00:00:54,890 --> 00:00:59,320
You're Sincerely, Wang Xingyu
